# Repository operating model
$vars['REPOSITORY_OPERATING_MODEL'] = @'
Azure Naming Tool — ASP.NET Core Blazor Server application (.NET 10.0) for generating
standardized Azure resource names. Layered architecture: Controllers (v1 + v2) → Services
(with `IXxxService` interfaces) → Repositories (`IConfigurationRepository<T>`,
`IStorageProvider`) → JSON files OR SQLite (EF Core, dual storage backend selected via
`StorageProvider` setting in `appsettings.json`). Blazor Components in `src/Components/`
provide the interactive UI. API authentication uses a custom `[ApiKey]` attribute with
three permission tiers. API versioning via `Asp.Versioning` (URL + header). Default seed
data lives in `src/repository/`; runtime config under `src/settings/`. ADRs are kept in
`docs/v5.0.0/adrs/`.
'@

